 "text": "Hi, how's everything with you? Totally understandable. Lisbon is great for fresh fish and pastries. Do you want explore the city, or would you rather get home to your family? Then maybe a walk around the city and dinner at a local place. Of course. It' a cherry birch, and it's fine. Maybe one day when you have a few minutes and fresh paint, yes. Cherry birches are lovely trees. They' worth it. You can even leave the thick trunk as a design feature. Then paint it while you' at it. No worries. Now I' really curious about your sister. Is she asking about the tree, or just randomly asking for an update?",
